ssir sa rentrée en Terminale S</h2><p class=\"font-body text-ardoise/80 line-clamp-3 mb-8 flex-1 leading-relaxed\">3 astuces express pour prendre de l&#x27;avance pendant l&#x27;été, sans sacrifier tes vacances.</p><div class=\"text-sm font-bold font-display uppercase tracking-widest text-encre flex items-center mt-auto group-hover:text-azur transition-colors\">Lire l&#x27;article<svg class=\"w-5 h-5 ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\"></path></svg></div></div></article></a><a class=\"group block h-full\" href=\"/blog/erreurs-maths-bac\"><article class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-encre/10 overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 h-full flex flex-col hover:-translate-y-2\"><div class=\"aspect-[16/9] w-full bg-[#040e21] relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(&#x27;/noise.svg&#x27;)] opacity-20 mix-blend-overlay pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-48 h-48 bg-azur/30 blur-[60px] rounded-full\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-48 h-48 bg-solaire/20 blur-[60px] rounded-full\"></div><span class=\"font-display text-white text-2xl tracking-widest uppercase opacity-90 relative z-10\">GTS <span class=\"text-azur\">News</span></span><div class=\"w-12 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-azur to-solaire mt-4 rounded-full relative z-10\"></div></div><div class=\"p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-azur/10 text-azur text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase rounded-full\">Conseils</span><span class=\"text-sm font-mono text-ardoise/60\">20 août 2026</span></div><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl text-encre mb-3 group-hover:text-azur transition-colors leading-tight\">Mathématiques : 3 erreurs qui coûtent la mention au Bac</h2><p class=\"font-body text-ardoise/80 line-clamp-3 mb-8 flex-1 leading-relaxed\">En Terminale S, comprendre la leçon ne suffit pas. Voici les erreurs classiques qui font perdre de précieux points le jour J.</p><div class=\"text-sm font-bold font-display uppercase tracking-widest text-encre flex items-center mt-auto group-hover:text-azur transition-colors\">Lire l&#x27;article<svg class=\"w-5 h-5 ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\"></path></svg></div></div></article></a><a class=\"group block h-full\" href=\"/blog/concours-esp-ept-conseils\"><article class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-encre/10 overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 h-full flex flex-col hover:-translate-y-2\"><div class=\"aspect-[16/9] w-full bg-[#040e21] relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(&#x27;/noise.svg&#x27;)] opacity-20 mix-blend-overlay pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-48 h-48 bg-azur/30 blur-[60px] rounded-full\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-48 h-48 bg-solaire/20 blur-[60px] rounded-full\"></div><span class=\"font-display text-white text-2xl tracking-widest uppercase opacity-90 relative z-10\">GTS <span class=\"text-azur\">News</span></span><div class=\"w-12 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-azur to-solaire mt-4 rounded-full relative z-10\"></div></div><div class=\"p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-azur/10 text-azur text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase rounded-full\">Conseils</span><span class=\"text-sm font-mono text-ardoise/60\">19 août 2026</span></div><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl text-encre mb-3 group-hover:text-azur transition-colors leading-tight\">Concours ESP / EPT : Le secret de ceux qui réussissent</h2><p class=\"font-body text-ardoise/80 line-clamp-3 mb-8 flex-1 leading-relaxed\">Les concours d&#x27;entrée aux grandes écoles au Sénégal ne testent pas que vos connaissances, ils testent votre rapidité. Voici comment faire la différence.</p><div class=\"text-sm font-bold font-display uppercase tracking-widest text-encre flex items-center mt-auto group-hover:text-azur transition-colors\">Lire l&#x27;article<svg class=\"w-5 h-5 ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\"></path></svg></div></div></article></a></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-[#061A3D] to-[#040e21] text-white/50 font-body text-sm border-t border-white/5\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 justify-between gap-8 mb-12\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-azur/20 to-solaire/20 border border-white/10\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-solaire\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M12 3l8 14H4l8-14z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-azur\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"font-display text-2xl text-white font-bold tracking-tight\">GTS</div></div><p class=\"max-w-xs\">L&#x27;excellence scientifique en ligne pour les lycéens du Sénégal.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:items-end gap-2\"><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/series\">Séries d&#x27;exercices</a><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/professeurs\">L&#x27;Équipe Pédagogique</a><a class=\"hover:text-white trans